{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>天氣漸凍，同時間東北冰雪美景亦正在製造中！中國東北將帶給大家真正的冰天雪地以及震撼冰雪奇觀！是次行程亮點： 大型冰雪藝術精品工程【冰雪大世界】 東北第一高峰【長白山北景區】 中國四大自然奇觀之一【松江中路觀霧松】 雪量中國之最、北國最高的山峰【雪鄉景區】</p><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061067/block/singleImage/3252812/df/01M63XZWWJ77KP2P3FN2QBW5JE.jpg?updatedAt=1793281254\"/><p>…………………… 已成團：27/12/2026、30/12； 03/01/2027、06/01、08/01、10/01、13/01、15/01、17/01、20/01、24/01、27/01 團號：TKSY08P 團費：成人$8,599起、小童$7,699</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T22:00:59.838614+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":256,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:15.132022+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:17.916516+00:00","content_hash":"a59e22c9b13bcf9d4e2fecf8e23134d08f29781f1951598a936efcacfdec596c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T22:00:59.838614+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}